            { 'Check the stone door again once Nunyunuwi is defeated to continue on.' },
            { 'In the next room, take the elevator down to the bottom (there are no Diremites at the bottom of this elevator ride).' },
            { 'Follow the path here until you reach another Stone Door for you to check, a cutscene will play and you will enter Promyvion - Vahzl.', sub = {
                { 'This is the 2nd of 2 Stone Doors mentioned here.' },
