                { 'If you have obtained the Key Item Lightsworm and are currently on an RoV mission involving the Walk of Echoes, you may use any blue ??? near the Cavernous Maws surrounding Jeuno (past or present) to zone in as a shortcut. (Unfortunately, this may not work if you are on Rhapsodies of Vanadiel Mission 2-18 (Somber Dreams). See the Lightsworm page for additional details.)' },
