        description  = 'Mission Orders: The shock of what resulted from Balamor\'s emergence has caused Arciela to lock herself away in her chambers. Meanwhile, Ygnas has asked that his family\'s heirloom necklace be returned, to which Ploh Trishbahk has agreed to act as liaison.',
