            { 'Venture to the Crag closest to your home Nation and click the Ergon Locus ??? located beneath the stairs leading up to the Telepoint to obtain Key Item Fistful of familiar soil and view a cutscene.', sub = {
                { 'If you are in the middle of Dances with Luopans and have not received a Key Item Luopan, you need to turn the Key Item Fistful of familiar soil into a Key Item Luopan first, then go get another Key Item Fistful of familiar soil for the cutscene.' },
                { 'Cannot be obtained while possessing Key Item Holla crystal of gales, Key Item Dem crystal of dunes, or Key Item Mea crystal of flames from Treasures of the Earth of the same type.', sub = {
