        subtitle     = 'None',
        repeatable   = 'No',
        description  = 'Mission Orders: Siren awaited you in Escha - Ru\'Aun, where she revealed a startling truth: not even Altana is able to stop the encroaching darkness and the cloud of nothingness. But don\'t lose heart--meeting with Iroha comes first.',
