        starting_npc = 'N/A',
        subtitle     = 'None',
        repeatable   = 'No',
        description  = 'Mission Orders: Gilgamesh and your allies from across Vana\'diel have gathered in Norg to check on you, but Iroha is nowhere to be found. She must have been hurled back to Reisenjima in the struggle. If only you could secure passage there...',
