                { 'Players should purchase a Key Item Mollifier KI from Shiftrix prior to completing this Mission otherwise the NM Ascended Panopt can spawn.' },
                { 'Zoning will reset your progress. You will receive a message informing you how many remain upon each kill.' },
                { 'Thanks to the June 2016 version update, the Key Item "Rhapsody in Fuschia" will reduce the level of any Obstreperous Panopts claimed by the player while on this mission.', sub = {
