                { 'If you have already attuned to the respective runic portals, the quickest way to get to each staging point is to use the Runic Portal at L-7 in Whitegate. Each warp will cost 200 Imperial Standing. Exchanging a single Copper Voucher will give you the required 1000 for all five warps. The warps will have no cost if done while under Assault orders for each location.' },
