            { 'Speak to Pagdako at (H-9) for some dialogue.' },
            { 'Speak to Blatherix at (F-8). Trade him 30 Gob. Chocolate or 5,000 gil to receive a Key ItemMine shaft key', sub = {
                { 'Gob. Chocolate is sold by Pawkrix in Lower Jeuno (H-10).' },
