            { 'Read the Unaddressed sealed letter by examining it in your Temporary Key Item menu.' },
            { 'Return to Erlene and talk to her again for a cutscene and a Key Item Porting magic transcript.' },
            { 'Go to Grauberg (S) (E-10) and enter the cave opposite the waterfall. Examine the unnamed shimmering light on the ground.', sub = {
