                { 'or take the Survival Guide to Batallia Downs and click the ??? next to the maw to use your Lightsworm to enter.' },
            } },
            { 'Select the Ornate Door up the stairs for a cutscene.' },
            { 'Cait Sith asks you to find a remnant of latent energy. The latent energy points are found in the following locations:', sub = {
                { 'This quest is the same fight as the previous quest except that you only need one Key Item Breath of dawn.' },
                { 'Beaucedine Glacier (S), there is an unlabeled (blank) point of interest down the hill on the border of G-9 and H-9. Select it for the Key Item Breath of dawn.' },
                { 'East Ronfaure (S), northwest corner of H-7 by a tree alongside the river. Select it for the Key Item Breath of dawn.' },
                { 'Jugner Forest (S), the southeast corner of Lake Mechieume has it, (I-6), just east of the river at the mouth of the lake. Select it for the Key Item Breath of dawn.', sub = {
                    { 'Survival guide warp to East Ronfaure (S) then head east in Jugner Forest (S) is the fastest way.' },
                } },
            } },
            { 'Take one of these three Key Items to Walk of Echoes through the Veridical Conflux at Grauberg (S) (F-5) or Pashhow Marshlands (S) (J-9) or using Lightsworm in Batallia Downs.' },
            { 'Check the Ornate Door for a cut scene, and again to begin the fight.' },
        },
    },
    ['The Dawn of Delectability'] = {
        title             = 'The Dawn of Delectability',
        starting_npc      = 'Ranpi-Monpi - Windurst Waters (S) (E-9)',
        subtitle          = 'None',
        repeatable        = 'No',
        description       = 'The outbreak of war has done away with any semblance of motivation aspiring chef Ranpi-Monpi may have had. If only he could experience the unique and extraordinarily new delectable dish that he dreams of...',
        level_restriction = 'None',
        pack              = 'Wings of the Goddess',
        requirements      = 'Bastore Sweeper Walnut Dragon Fruit Pepperoni',
        rewards           = 'Trainee Knife',
        previous_quest    = 'None',
        next_quest        = 'None',
        walkthrough       = {
            { 'Talk to Ranpi-Monpi in Windurst Waters (S) for the initial cutscene.', sub = {
                { '(Optional) Speak to him again for additional dialogue.' },
            } },
            { 'Go to the present Windurst Waters and talk to Ranpi-Monpi for a cutscene.' },
            { 'You will need to get the following items. They can all be purchased from the Auction House or gathered / crafted.', sub = {
                { 'Bastore Sweeper - Can be fished up in Vunkerl Inlet (S)' },
                { 'Walnut - Can be logged in East Ronfaure (S), uncommon.' },
                { 'Dragon Fruit - Can be logged in Fort Karugo-Narugo (S), common.' },
                { 'Pepperoni - Cooking synthesis(level 85).' },
            } },
            { 'Trade the above items to Ranpi-Monpi and wait one game day for the dish to be completed.', sub = {
                { '(Optional) Speak to him again before the day is up for additional dialogue.' },
            } },
            { 'After receiving Key Item Ranpi-Monpi Specialty go back to Windurst Waters (S) and talk to Ranpi-Monpi to feed the young lad. You\'ll receive a Key Item Culinary knife.', sub = {
                { '(Optional) Speak to him again for some additional dialogue.' },
            } },
            { 'Return this knife to Ranpi-Monpi in the present and you will get your reward.' },
        },
    },
