                { 'If you are doing the quest for multiple people, you must wait 4 minutes to re-spawn the Forger for another Bomb Steel.' },
            } },
            { 'Purchase a Hatchet and travel to The Sanctuary of Zi\'Tah. You will find an area off of the map in the northern part of (K-10) that will take you to a block at (L-9). There you will find a ??? spot you may reach by climbing up a nearby rock. Use the Hatchet on the ??? spot to spawn a Treant Notorious Monster named Guardian Treant.', sub = {
