            { 'Travel to Sauromugue Champaign and find the cave at (L-10). To get there, go up the cliff at (L-8). Examine the Tiger Bones in the cave to spawn the Old Sabertooth and watch it die naturally, a process which takes approximately three agonizing earth minutes.', sub = {
                { 'Easiest way to reach the cave is via the Survival Guide located at (J-9/J-10).' },
