            { 'Travel to Eastern Altepa Desert and look for the entrance to Quicksand Caves at (J-7) (where the level 30+ beetle/antica camp is). This will put you at the first map of Quicksand Caves at (L-4). You will need to travel to (E-10) of the map, to find a hidden entrance to the Cloister of Tremors. The map to the right hand side shows you the map with the hidden tunnels, falls and other traps. Be careful to not fall into the wrong areas.', sub = {
