        level_restriction = 'None',
        pack              = 'Abyssea',
        requirements      = 'Empyrean Armor equipped',
        rewards           = 'Stearc Subligar with random Augments Chance at one of the following Empyrean Armor +1 Body seals: Orison Seal: Body (WHM) Bale Seal: Body (DRK) Ferine Seal: Body (BST) Aoidos\' Seal: Body (BRD) Navarch\'s Seal: Body (COR)',
        previous_quest    = 'None',
        next_quest        = 'None',
        walkthrough       = {
            { 'Speak to Brygid (A) at (D-11), near Conflux #8, while wearing at least 1 piece of Empyrean Armor.', sub = {
                { 'You cannot use upgraded iLvl 119 Empyrean Gear it must be original Empyrean Armor' },
            } },
            { 'Brygid (A) requests you wear certain body and leg equipment depending on the job you approach her as. Speak to her again while having both pieces equipped for your reward.', sub = {
                { 'If you are already wearing some of the possible gear for your current job that Brygid (A) might select for you to wear, she will never select that gear, and will always suggest something else. Because of this, if you do not possess all of the possible equipment that Brygid (A) might select for you to wear, it is recommended to unequip your body/legs armor prior to initiating the quest, to decrease the chances of Brygid (A) selecting the equipment you do not have.' },
                { 'Unlike previous quests, Brygid (A) will accept both standard and HQ (+1) versions of gear. I.E. both a Orison Cap or a Orison Cap +1 will initiate the quest, and if she requests for you to wear a Scorpion Harness, a Scorpion Harness +1 will also fulfill the requirement.' },
                { 'If you cannot find or obtain a piece of the equipment she asks for, you can talk to her again and she\'ll ask if you want to continue or quit. Electing to quit will remove the quest from your \'current\' logs. You will have to rezone and talk to her again to redo/restart the quest, which will then randomize another pair of gear.' },
            } },
        },
    },
