            { 'Guide the chocobo to the Repair Crate located at (H-11) avoiding all aggro. You will receive a message when the chocobo is close enough and can be loaded.', sub = {
                { 'If a monster is in line-of-sight of a chocobo, it will run back to the last safe spot without monsters.' },
