                { 'Select Option 1 three times' },
                { 'Select Option 1 in the next question' },
                { 'Select Option 2 in the next question' },
                { 'Select Option 1 in the next question' },
            } },
            { 'He will then give you the quest that requires 3 Rabbit Hide and 1 Raaz Tusk. Snowpelt Rabbits[1] in Kamihr Drifts do not drop Rabbit Hides, but local Cicatricose Raaz do drop tusks.', sub = {
                { 'Serac Rabbits in Woh Gates adjacent to the Kamihr Drifts zone drop Rabbit Hides.' },
                { 'Cletae in Southern San d\'Oria (D-8) sells hides for 80g.' },
                { 'If you have the Key ItemBaby rabbit memento from Monster Rearing, your Green Thumb Moogle also sells Rabbit Hide.' },
            } },
            { 'Trade all four items to Traiffeaux.', sub = {
                { 'Note: If you are running Windower or Ashita you will likely get a black screen after you give him the items.', sub = {
