            { 'Travel to at least three of the following eight Strange Apparatuses to receive key items. Note: Invisible walls may or may not exist, and the apparatuses are located behind them. Please be aware of your surroundings as this is some incredibly complicated stuff.', sub = {
                { 'Dangruf Wadi (E-11)', sub = {
