            { 'Click on the Door: Amuchuchu\'s Laboratory in the back of the Inventors\' Coalition for a cutscene.' },
            { 'Check the ??? in Yorcia Weald at (I-8) (Near Ergon Locus "Bryophitic Boulder") for a cutscene. You will obtain the Key Item Midras\'s explosive sample and Key Item Report on Midras\'s explosive.', sub = {
                { 'NOT located in the field of Numbing Blossoms at I-8, which also has an Ergon Locus' },
